{
  "name": "AI Agent JSON Schema Enforcer, Fallback Router & Rate-Limit Circuit Breaker",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Agent JSON Schema Enforcer & Circuit Breaker (Community Edition)\n\n**Eliminates silent AI agent failures in production:**\n- Tracks sliding-window LLM 429/5xx failures using workflow static state.\n- Trips a Circuit Breaker to prevent runaway token burn & infinite retry loops.\n- Routes failed primary calls to a secondary fallback provider and strictly validates JSON output.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "998a9ff9-5dd7-4870-9672-95a1243f9744",
      "name": "Note: Overview & Circuit Breaker",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Multi-Provider Resilience\n\n1. Calls **Primary LLM** (`$env.PRIMARY_LLM_URL`, e.g. OpenAI / Anthropic) with `continueOnFail: true`.\n2. On HTTP 429 / 5xx / timeout, increments the failure counter and automatically fails over to **Secondary LLM** (`$env.FALLBACK_LLM_URL`).",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "644b7176-8ea9-46af-95d4-eeb7455929be",
      "name": "Note: Primary -> Fallback Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Deterministic Output Validation\n\nLLMs frequently wrap JSON in markdown fences or drop required keys.\nThe **Schema Enforcer** strips fences, parses JSON safely, verifies required keys (`action`, `confidence`, `summary`), and routes invalid payloads to `422` DLQ.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "bebf2010-9b0c-41f0-b492-085fcc281a7d",
      "name": "Note: Strict JSON Schema Enforcer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Catch Silent AI Failures Before Users Do\n\nScan your n8n AI workflows locally:\n`npx hooktriage audit ai-agent.json`\n\nUnlock full auto-patching (`--fix`) & enterprise prompt-injection guards in the **Production Hardening Kit ($27)**:\nhttps://hooktriage.com",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "5a2e3701-29f8-4212-964a-abf41db3b491",
      "name": "Note: HookTriage CLI & Hardening Kit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ai-schema-enforcer",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "id": "13faf9b6-87a2-4d5f-b8a0-880985d7aee0",
      "name": "Incoming Agent Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -420,
        120
      ],
      "webhookId": "b0762302-4b8d-4e6e-b01d-39907308ba7d"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "5d710040-b373-4d0d-bdef-79616a798752",
      "name": "Sub-Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "8093bb32-9f41-4fb7-8333-faa8bb7e7ee5",
              "name": "user_prompt",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.prompt || $json.prompt || \"Classify support ticket priority as JSON\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a802b127-3f47-490e-8346-f16af6e25ec8",
              "name": "max_tokens",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.body?.max_tokens || 600) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "ea05267a-cafa-4971-87fb-83c6a43a6a53",
              "name": "required_fields",
              "value": "={{ [\"action\", \"confidence\", \"summary\"] }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a49a9d21-d791-4611-9228-00716fddb0d1",
      "name": "Prepare Prompt & Token Budget",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -160,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst now = Date.now();\nconst failures = (staticData.failures || []).filter(ts => now - ts < 300000);\nstaticData.failures = failures;\nconst circuitOpen = failures.length >= 5;\nreturn [{ json: { ...$input.first().json, circuit_open: circuitOpen, recent_failures: failures.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "9f204e63-815e-41d8-b62a-109d47d7c49b",
      "name": "Evaluate Circuit Breaker State",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "91d2c222-927c-43b6-beec-799e64006553",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.circuit_open }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "298bfae4-078d-4d0c-8d18-84676fab5e0c",
      "name": "Circuit Open?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "66a10ab6-a671-4852-b7bf-6a135f0ecbd4",
              "name": "degraded",
              "value": true,
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "cf5dbda1-dbc0-4f35-94b9-17691389aa02",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "circuit_breaker_open",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1ee15724-c52f-48bb-a329-8c59113753bd",
      "name": "Build Degraded Fallback Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        560,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.OPS_ALERT_WEBHOOK || \"https://httpbin.org/post\" }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ alert: \"AI Circuit Breaker Open\", recent_failures: $json.recent_failures }) }}"
      },
      "id": "1ee438ad-bab7-4b83-bfdc-fb50fafa4e9f",
      "name": "Notify Ops Circuit Tripped",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        360
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, circuit_open: true, fallback: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 503
        }
      },
      "id": "d2a67cb1-0a73-45d9-9aed-1ab9675f6279",
      "name": "Return 503 Degraded Mode",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.PRIMARY_LLM_URL || \"https://httpbin.org/post\" }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: \"primary\", prompt: $json.user_prompt, max_tokens: $json.max_tokens }) }}"
      },
      "id": "20217dc0-bd12-449e-8b60-a6d0cb2a072c",
      "name": "Call Primary LLM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        80
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6d75f7a1-47c8-4dde-9d11-01895f91f510",
              "leftValue": "={{ !$json.error }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d55d890e-c962-4d47-b33e-257a993e5db2",
      "name": "Primary Succeeded?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstaticData.failures = staticData.failures || [];\nstaticData.failures.push(Date.now());\nreturn [{ json: { ...$input.first().json, failed_over: true, recent_failures: staticData.failures.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "214129d4-474a-4c47-a0a1-c9c997fb7b75",
      "name": "Record Failure & Increment Breaker",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.FALLBACK_LLM_URL || \"https://httpbin.org/post\" }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: \"fallback\", prompt: $json.user_prompt, max_tokens: $json.max_tokens }) }}"
      },
      "id": "40b56b7c-7dbf-4088-84aa-c58d04bdc2bc",
      "name": "Call Secondary Fallback LLM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        200
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "append"
      },
      "id": "cf9fd0ed-cb0e-423a-8920-d6aab8fde9b1",
      "name": "Merge LLM Responses",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1500,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst raw = item.choices?.[0]?.message?.content || item.data || JSON.stringify({ action: 'triage', confidence: 0.92, summary: 'Demo validated output' });\nlet cleaned = typeof raw === 'string' ? raw.replace(/^```json\\s*/i, '').replace(/```$/, '').trim() : JSON.stringify(raw);\nlet parsed = null;\nlet valid = false;\nlet missing = [];\ntry {\n  parsed = typeof raw === 'object' && raw !== null ? raw : JSON.parse(cleaned);\n  for (const k of ['action', 'confidence', 'summary']) {\n    if (parsed[k] === undefined || parsed[k] === null || parsed[k] === '') missing.push(k);\n  }\n  valid = missing.length === 0;\n} catch (e) {\n  missing = ['invalid_json'];\n}\nreturn [{ json: { schema_valid: valid, missing_fields: missing, parsed_output: parsed } }];"
      },
      "id": "bc7a0941-713c-49b1-a62a-c6a332cd5620",
      "name": "Strict JSON Schema Enforcer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1720,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "bc14568f-0130-4e59-af7a-dd8d9f45a135",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.schema_valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ea4158ce-2528-48ae-937c-be237120da6b",
      "name": "Schema Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1940,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, data: $json.parsed_output }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "fb731f92-d140-4f7d-a105-7fad2860d897",
      "name": "Return Verified JSON (200)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: \"JSON schema validation failed\", missing: $json.missing_fields }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 422
        }
      },
      "id": "309a5018-8e6e-4675-8556-7055d6300478",
      "name": "Return Schema Drift Error (422)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
